Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟群没有指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么从不相撞？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有会议
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没有领导
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只有三条规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一只猛禽斜穿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟群瞬间撕开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.57,0:00:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,每一只
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,都只看着身边的七只
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,黏菌没有大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,却能画出最优路线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,同一张网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,被工程师抄成了地铁图
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,五个细胞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,能演化出会飞的滑翔机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,第五十六代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,它自己走了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一个机制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住了四个尺度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你的大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也是这样亮起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,同一套规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也能让群体瞬间崩散
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,越过临界点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,崩塌只用了一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,以为它们只是各自在飞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,错了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,涌现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,整体有了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,个体却没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:01:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你无法从一只鸟，读出整个鸟群
